sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>AdminIssueReportsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>RectifyIssueReportBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>RectifyIssueReportController
  participant IssueReport as «entity»<br/>IssueReport
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: mark a report rectified
  UI->>B: PATCH /api/admin/issue-reports/{id}/rectify (JWT)
  B->>C: rectify(Integer adminId, Integer reportId)
  alt already RECTIFIED
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>IssueReport: rectify()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>C: result
  C->>IssueReport: save()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>C: result
  C-->>B: IssueReportResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end